erm": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "对"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "universal object", "target_term": "泛对象"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "universal", "target_term": "泛的"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category），<MATH_0002>是可表（representable）函子（functor）。选取对象（object）<MATH_0003>，它属于<MATH_0004>，以及同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0005>。米田引理（Yoneda lemma）保证，对（pair）<MATH_0006>在唯一同构（isomorphism）的意义下唯一。对象（object）<MATH_0007>称为一个对象（object），它<TEXTITOPEN_0001>表示（representing）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><MATH_0008>。由米田引理（Yoneda lemma），变换（transformation）<MATH_0009>对应于唯一的元素（element）<MATH_0010>。这个元素（element）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>泛对象（universal object）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。它具有如下性质：对于<MATH_0011>，映射（map）\n<MATH_0012>\n是双射（bijection）。因此，<MATH_0013>是泛的（universal），其含义是<MATH_0014>的每个元素（element）都等于<MATH_0015>在<MATH_0016>下的像（image），其中态射（morphism）<MATH_0017>在<MATH_0018>中唯一。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:651213c6a61959b877f9499759003b41f89c4530e8762c254f977437190707c2", "unit_id": "tag:001L:prose-0005", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所给范畴；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "可由对象表示的函子；暂定译法。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"context": "所给可表函子；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "范畴中的对象；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "表示的同构及唯一性；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "所引用引理；暂定译法。", "source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"context": "对象及所选同构组成的对；暂定译法。", "source_term": "pair", "target_term": "对"}, {"context": "定义表示该函子的对象；暂定译法。", "source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"context": "给定表示同构；暂定译法。", "source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换"}, {"context": "函子取值中的元素；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"context": "本段定义的元素名称；暂定译法。", "source_term": "universal object", "target_term": "泛对象"}, {"context": "表示给出的映射；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "表示给出的双射；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"context": "泛元素的性质；暂定译法。", "source_term": "universal", "target_term": "泛的"}, {"context": "元素在映射下的像；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"context": "确定该像的唯一态射；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}]}
